WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:41.370
Under the rule of Ei Sei,
the King who worked toward unification,

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:45.500
the Kingdom of Chin launched an invasion
of the neighboring land of Gi.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.660
Ou Hon, Mou Ten, and Shin:

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:52.370
these bold soldiers and aspiring
great generals were together here now,

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.120
ready to usher in a brand-new age!

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.500
Shin, look!

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:00.620
What is it?!

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.580
The Gyoku Hou Force finally gained a foothold,

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.080
but the ladder brigade isn't following up on it.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.700
I bet...

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.250
this was the Gyoku Hou Force's own sneak attack,

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.830
one the other squads don't know about.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.330
But that means...

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.330
Uh-huh:

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:22.620
The Gyoku Hou Force is alone
and helpless with that big army!

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:26.450
But it's all gone according to plan so far.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.330
Why don't we just see what you can do

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.080
from up there,

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.120
Ou Hon.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:42.040
"The Way I Fight"

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.950
Kill 'em!

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.540
Just go in there and smash 'em!

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:53.000
Kill 'em! Gang up on 'em!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.950
They seem to be getting shoved off to the left.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:03:00.200
They won't be able to strike
the crucial wall commander like that.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.870
Ohhh, I get it!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.750
The guys at the bottom
who put up the smokescreen

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.790
are standing by... on their horses?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:22.080
They're nearly done for, sir!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.160
Ou Hon, sir!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.160
You truly are

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.290
a force to be reckoned with...

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.120
Defenses, circle up!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.000
What the--

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.120
What's going on?

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.750
They've set up a base... there, of all places!

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.500
Rope?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.620
From the very beginning,

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.750
I was never after your head.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.660
I-It can't be! But that's...

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.370
...right over the castle gates!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.120
Gatekeepers! Look sharp!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.040
The enemy is approaching!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:20.500
The enemy!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.830
They mean to open the gates!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:24.790
Kill them!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.830
Don't let them open anything!

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:28.290
Too late!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.120
The smokescreen brigade is waiting down below

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.950
to storm the castle the moment
we open the gates from within!

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.870
There's not a speck of fat
to trim in this strategy.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:46.870
Who'd ever believe it came
from the mind of such a young commander?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:50.620
They all ought to keep a close eye on him now!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.700
Soon the whole world
will be singing his praises:

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.700
Such is the prowess of Ou Hon!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.250
Open the gates!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:03.330
Yahoo!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:05.870
Wha--

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.540
What the hell's goin' on up there?

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:24.870
What the--?!

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:32.540
The commanders guarding
the castle walls were speechless.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.830
Before they knew it, the Chin flag
was flying over the main castle,

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.160
where the castle's lord resided.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.160
In other words,

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.290
Gao Lang Castle had fallen.

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.450
From Mou Ten's Gaku Ka Force storming the gates

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.040
to the fall of the main castle,

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:51.620
the job was over as quick as lightning.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.040
Gaku Ka Force!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.830
Just what do you think you're doing?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.580
This gate was Gyoku Hou's to storm!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:05.200
You don't get to slip in
and snatch it away from us!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:09.120
That's thievery, plain and simple!
You should be ashamed!

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.620
Thief? Who's a thief?!

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.620
You mean to insult Mou Ten?

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:19.450
And why wouldn't we?
You Gaku Ka Force jokers are always--

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:20.540
Always what? Out with it!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.080
All right, fine! You asked for it!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.080
You're always getting in our way!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.080
C'mon, Shin. This has nothing to do with us.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.000
And you're always stealing our thunder!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.790
No, that's <i>you</i> ! Not us!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.290
Stop--that's enough.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.870
They're free to pass through the open gate.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:40.330
The problem lies in our
letting them get there first.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.830
Ou Hon...

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.540
Ou Hon, sir...

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.290
Yes, see? Like I said!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.410
Mou Ten! Why, you...

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:49.620
Kidding!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:54.000
We owe you one.
We'll pay you back someday for sure.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:59.160
No need. I'll just make sure my
future strategies include a pitfall

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.910
with your name on it.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.200
Yikes! That's not good!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.040
Hey! Shin of the Hi Shin Unit!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.160
Why watch from down there?
Come on up already!

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.580
Let's go.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.250
Sir!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.540
Oh, dear!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.750
Gone without even a thank-you?

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.750
I don't talk to losers.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:34.160
Hey, Ou Hon--who you callin' a loser?!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.540
You bastards don't play fair!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.200
Bringin' in a big ol' thing like that...

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:43.500
Hell, even <i>we</i> could
take down a castle with <i>that</i> !

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:48.870
Just as it's not unfair for one
who knows the sword to wield a sword,

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:52.450
I simply used the siege tower
I happened to have on hand.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.160
You find the strangest faults.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.500
Nobility is a gift, too, you know.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.700
You little...

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:04.910
Now, now! Don't get so riled up!
It's only the first castle.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.750
We're just getting started.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.870
Hey... do you smell smoke?

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:17.700
Fire!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:19.450
There's fires going up all over town!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.040
Don't tell me...

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.330
Wait.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.750
We shouldn't get involved.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:41.040
What are you talking about?!
Let me go, dammit!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.160
Hey, Shin!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:43.910
Shin!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.290
Shin, sir!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.620
Kyou Kai, you take over!

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:19.410
Wha--

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.830
What the hell are you doing?!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.370
No, Shin! Stay back!

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:30.620
Let me go, En! Why are you stoppin' me?!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:32.410
They're on our side!

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:36.160
Fighting allies is a serious crime!
It might even cost you your head!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.450
What are <i>they</i> doin' here...?

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:43.290
Hey, you! This place belongs
to my thousand-man squad!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.580
If you're lookin' for some loot,
look somewhere else!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.620
Bastard!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.750
S-Shin!

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:49.950
Let me go, dammit!

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:49.950
Help me hold him!

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.540
Let me go! En!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.040
Shin!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.750
This is just how it is!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:04.160
We've only had victory in mind,
but this battle <i>is</i> an invasion...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:08.370
Unfortunately, this kind of thing
comes with the territory--

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.370
always.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:18.580
I know... Oh, I know, all right.
I know war ain't pretty...

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.700
But that doesn't mean...

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.200
I gotta shut up and let
this kind of thing slide!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:29.290
We won't. The army has rules, regulations.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:34.750
You there! Commander!
Stop your rampage at once!

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.910
The enemy has already surrendered!

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.750
This is a clear violation of military law!

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.910
We'll be reporting this to your superiors!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.040
Don't make things worse--
it's for your own good!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.040
Huh?

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:56.290
So <i>that's</i> what their deal is!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.120
Man, what a pain!

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:03.160
I am Ran Dou, leader of
a thousand men! Now get lost!

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.160
You newbies don't know
the first thing about war!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.790
Ain't no law in any army
that says anythin' about

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:13.250
killin' someone who's already surrendered!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.950
This here is a special privilege for the winner!

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:21.660
And don't you forget it!

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:25.750
Near a hundred of my own men
died in this battle...

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.540
Stop!

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:42.620
It don't matter to me how many Gi pigs die!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.000
You bastard!

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:54.160
That idiot! He's gone out in front.
Kill him if you want!

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.160
Sir!

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.830
Shin! Don't kill him!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.540
Just <i>this</i> guy...

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.620
Shin, no!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:17.830
Mou Ten!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.290
I know you know that killing
a thousand-man commander

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.410
will mean you lose everything.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.620
And I mean <i>everything</i> .

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:28.540
Shut up!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:30.540
Shin...

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:36.830
Is it worth all your dreams
of being a great general?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.990
"Mou Ten"

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:47.620
You punk...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:52.250
You know what you're getting yourself into?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:56.120
A nothin' like you kills
a thousand-man commander like me,

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.870
that means your head.

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:04.080
All your buddies'll get swept up in it, too.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:07.200
The man's telling the truth.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.160
Put the sword away, Shin.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.370
You--

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:17.000
Tell your minions to lay off
the underhanded crap right now.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.870
Then swear you won't lay a finger
on any surrendered townsfolk

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.830
ever again!

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.450
Don't be stupid! I ain't gonna make 'em stop,

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.450
and I'm gonna keep doing
what I want with these losers, too!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.160
Hell, that's why I go to war--I love that part!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.910
Got it?!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:40.120
You march in here all righteous,
with no clue about reality...

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:43.290
Nothin' pisses me off more!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.290
Now you've d--

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:03.790
Nothin' pisses <i>me</i> off more than people like you

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:07.500
who blame reality,
tryin' to justify the crap they pull!

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:13.290
"Everybody does it"?
What kind of an excuse is that?!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.250
Evil is evil!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:18.040
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit will
<i>never</i> put up with an evil man,

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.750
no matter what his reasons may be!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.580
It doesn't matter if he's a
thousand-man commander, a general--

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:26.040
or a king!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.540
That's the way I fight--
always has been, always will be.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.160
Period!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:43.120
Pretendin' I didn't see all this
outta fear of bein' punished?

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.540
What kind of world's
greatest general does that?!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.790
Shin!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.370
Wh-What the hell are they up to?!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.910
Never mind that--kill them!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.370
Avenge our commander!

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:08.500
Wait! That's the famous Hi Shin Unit,
from the eastern front!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.500
It is?

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:12.410
But to just let him kill
a thousand-man commander like that...

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.580
Oh, don't worry.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.540
He killed a thousand-man commander.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:20.330
He'll be court-martialed
and beheaded before you know it.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:27.660
Eh? Are you kiddin' me?!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:32.910
Why's <i>he</i> get pardoned
and <i>we</i> get interrogated?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.790
He hasn't been pardoned;
he's being held overnight.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.500
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit
had to strike back in self-defense

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.330
after the thousand-man commander
Ran Dou attacked him first.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:47.000
I understand Ran Dou's
wounds weren't even that deep.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:51.870
On the other hand, your excessive
barbarism toward surrendered foes

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.830
calls for a court-martial.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.830
It has been approved! Approach at once!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.750
I shall start with you, Lieutenant.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.700
Hey! Let me go, you goons!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.580
Listen! Just listen, all right?!

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.250
We're not the only ones, you know!
Everybody's doing it!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.830
Men from my own squad,

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:12.830
Thank goodness.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:16.200
Just because that commander is still alive

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:21.660
doesn't mean I wasn't worried
that Shin would lose his head...

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.580
Does this happen often?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.000
Hmm?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.700
I mean, this all turned out
a little too well for us.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.500
You're right...

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.660
Kyou Kai?

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.950
Come on, you too!

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.700
Ow! Hands off!

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:46.330
How's that, then, young sir?

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.830
You've been a big help, General Ra Gen.

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.290
I'll pay you back before long.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.370
Oho, those are some fine words indeed!

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.700
I'll be waiting with bated breath.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.040
So this is your doing?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.370
Ou Hon!

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.160
Unlike you, I have no qualms
about trading on my father's

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.200
and grandfather's influence.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:15.580
Making this kind of thing go away?
Piece of cake.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.500
Why would you help someone like him?

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:27.040
He's a child. He leads 300 men,
yet cannot control his emotions?

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.580
It would serve him right if he were beheaded.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:35.370
Taking down one or two
rogue commanders won't change a thing.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.870
If you really want to make changes in the army,

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.410
you've got to be at the very top.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:47.410
Exactly. And that's why we've been
closing our eyes to barbaric acts.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.200
But you know--

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.540
I'm pretty sure Shin knows that, too.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:56.950
He knew full well, and still did what he did.

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:02.200
His confidence in himself
is absolutely unwavering,

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.620
straight as an arrow flying through the air.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:11.120
He has his own path to becoming
one of the world's greatest generals.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:15.910
I like him, that Shin of the Hi Shin Unit.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.830
Confidence or no, a fool is still a fool.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:23.870
What's more, he's starting
out fatally far down the ladder.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:29.290
And yet, I've been thinking...

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.040
he could be a formidable foe
for us somewhere down the road.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.080
Yikes, right?

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.250
Don't make me laugh.

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:46.040
We don't want to have to hurt you.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:51.080
What are you gonna do with
your parents gone? Just come quietly.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:55.450
We get paid, y'know.
You can live a pretty good life.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:02.000
You really think they'll sell,
lookin' so poor and all?

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.870
Good point. Let's look somewhere else.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.700
Yeah, right.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.870
Why let you live if you
won't bring us any money?

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.160
So what if you're children?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.200
The people of Gi are our enemy!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.000
Th-Thank you so much...

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.120
You all right?

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:40.250
Uh-huh.

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:44.120
Wow. You shielded your little sister?

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.370
Well, she's my sister.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.950
What's her name?

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.660
Shun.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.500
You can't cry forever, Shun.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.370
Your big sister can't
be helping you all the time.

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:02.120
Be a big girl and join forces
with her now, okay?

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:05.160
You two are sisters, after all.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:06.200
Uh-huh...

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:12.410
Can you walk? I'll take you
to where the rest of the villagers are.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:14.290
You'll be fine there.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.290
I'm not gonna cry!

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.620
You want out?

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.790
Nah. I'm reflectin'.

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:59.870
I'm glad I got off with
a miraculous slap on the wrist,

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:03.660
but I really put you and the
rest of the squad in a tight spot.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:10.660
So I decided to stay up all night
thinkin' about what I did.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.790
Not that I regret cuttin' down
that bastard, though.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.040
Ah.

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:18.950
See you.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.620
Whoa! Hang on!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:24.080
I got some time on my hands--
stick around and talk!

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:27.410
You said you were reflecting.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.950
Oh, and bring me somethin' to eat,
wouldja? I'm starvin'!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:32.370
You've got to be kidding.

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:40.250
The furor over Shin attacking
a thousand-man commander

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:43.910
was prevented from boiling over
thanks to Mou Ten's maneuvering.

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:48.160
The Hi Shin Unit was now
a little more well known

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.580
among the Chin army and the people of Gi,

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:53.450
for new and different reasons.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:59.000
Meanwhile, credit for this
first battle of the war went to

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:02.700
Ou Hon of the Gyoku Hou Force
and Mou Ten of the Gaku Ka Force.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.160
Their two squadrons brought
down the first castle, Gao Lang,

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:09.750
in but a single day.

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.790
The next morning,

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:16.540
there came word that
General Mou Gou's two lieutenants

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:20.080
had taken down their own Gi castles
with their detached force.

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:25.330
The Chin army's offensive
was off to a good start.

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:30.040
However,

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:32.790
no one realized at the time

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:36.250
that further on down the road,

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:39.950
they would be facing off against
an unthinkably huge opponent.

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:47.040
"Dairyou, Kingdom of Gi"

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:50.660
Those Chin mongrels have invaded our land,

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:54.060
"King Kei Bin of Gi"

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:54.660
and now even Kyo Chu and Kyo Sai have fallen.

00:22:54.660 --> 00:22:56.000
And yet...

00:22:56.000 --> 00:23:01.120
my heart remains free from terror--
because <i>you</i> are here.

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:06.080
Formerly of Sho's Three Greats...

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:08.330
General Ren Pa!

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:12.450
In the three years
you have been exiled to our land,

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.790
never before have I been so
grateful for your presence!

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Man Ren Pa"
